<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Staples, Office Depot unchanged.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Staples, Office Depot unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proposed merger between Staples Inc, and Office Depot Inc was looking more likely late Wednesday, but in after-hours trading both stocks were unchanged from the close, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's some orders out there, but nothing's trading out of line,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Staples closed at 22, down 1-1/4 on the day. Office Depot closed at 22-5/8, up 3-3/8 during regular trading hours.</p>
<p>OfficeMax Inc agreed Wednesday to buy 63 stores from Staples and Office Depot, a Staples bid to help persuade the U.S. Federal Trade Commission to approve the merger.</p>
</text>
